iple projects adopt OpenMDW they will not be able to use the SPDX identifier because it does not exist. \n\nEffectively all of the projects that adopt OpenMDW before the license is approved would not be able to take advantage of SPDX guidelines on day 1 and only projects after the license is approved would be able to do so.\n\nCould someone please share what has happened with other licenses?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2891985989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2892029923","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2732#issuecomment-2892029923","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2732","id":2892029923,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86sYN_j","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false